# Field annotation: field@Child in constructor body (T-1052)
# @Child marks fields whose declared type contains TypeNode children.
# Priority 2b: Record + ImmediateAt → Dict frame. The field key is
# SurfaceExpression::Annotated { name: "fields", annotation: Simple("Child") }.
# Type resolution strips @Child and uses "fields" as the field name.
[Color: [type [Record@[guarding: True]  fields@Child: String  open: Bool]]]
=== out
["Color": [type [Record@["guarding": True]  fields@Child: String  "open": Bool]]]
